  },
  {
   "id": "el56",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1630,
   "y": 100,
   "width": 541.62,
   "height": 403.75,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 1818292820,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 1069832397,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "1. requestL2TransactionTwoBridges on L1Bridgehub\n2. bridgehubDepositBaseToken on L1AssetRouter (mintValue)\n3. bridgeBurn on L1NativeTokenVault (chain's base token)\n4. safeTransferFrom user (skipped for ETH: held by the NTV)\n5. bridgehubDeposit on L1AssetRouter (secondBridgeAddress)\n6. bridgeBurn on L1NativeTokenVault (deposited asset)\n7. safeTransferFrom user into escrow (L1-native token) or\n\u2003\u2003bridgeBurn (bridged token); skipped for ETH\n8. bridgehubRequestL2Transaction on the chain's Mailbox;\n\u2003\u2003sender = L1AssetRouter, appended to the priority tree\n9. bridgehubConfirmL2Transaction on L1AssetRouter\n10. bridgehubConfirmL2TransactionForwarded on L1Nullifier\n\u2003\u2003(records depositHappened for failed-deposit claims)\n11. priority tx: finalizeDeposit on L2AssetRouter\n\u2003\u2003(from aliased L1AssetRouter)\n12. bridgeMint on L2NativeTokenVault\n13. handleFinalizeBridgingOnL2 on L2AssetTracker\n14. deploy on first deposit, then bridgeMint to receiver\n\u2003\u2003(an L2-native token is released from escrow instead)",
   "originalText": "1. requestL2TransactionTwoBridges on L1Bridgehub\n2. bridgehubDepositBaseToken on L1AssetRouter (mintValue)\n3. bridgeBurn on L1NativeTokenVault (chain's base token)\n4. safeTransferFrom user (skipped for ETH: held by the NTV)\n5. bridgehubDeposit on L1AssetRouter (secondBridgeAddress)\n6. bridgeBurn on L1NativeTokenVault (deposited asset)\n7. safeTransferFrom user into escrow (L1-native token) or\n\u2003\u2003bridgeBurn (bridged token); skipped for ETH\n8. bridgehubRequestL2Transaction on the chain's Mailbox;\n\u2003\u2003sender = L1AssetRouter, appended to the priority tree\n9. bridgehubConfirmL2Transaction on L1AssetRouter\n10. bridgehubConfirmL2TransactionForwarded on L1Nullifier\n\u2003\u2003(records depositHappened for failed-deposit claims)\n11. priority tx: finalizeDeposit on L2AssetRouter\n\u2003\u2003(from aliased L1AssetRouter)\n12. bridgeMint on L2NativeTokenVault\n13. handleFinalizeBridgingOnL2 on L2AssetTracker\n14. deploy on first deposit, then bridgeMint to receiver\n\u2003\u2003(an L2-native token is released from escrow instead)",
   "fontSize": 17,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
  {
   "id": "el57",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 1180,
   "y": 650,
   "width": 345.6,
   "height": 60.0,
   "angle": 0,
   "strokeColor": "#343a40",
   "backgroundColor": "transparent",
   "fillStyle": "solid",
   "strokeWidth": 2,
   "strokeStyle": "solid",
   "roughness": 0,
   "opacity": 100,
   "groupIds": [],
   "frameId": null,
   "roundness": null,
   "seed": 542671142,
   "version": 1,
   "versionNonce": 108958110,
   "isDeleted": false,
   "boundElements": [],
   "updated": 1,
   "link": null,
   "locked": false,
   "text": "ETH to a non-ETH-based chain: same flow;\nstep 4 pulls the base token, step 7 is\nskipped (ETH sent as secondBridgeValue).",
   "originalText": "ETH to a non-ETH-based chain: same flow;\nstep 4 pulls the base token, step 7 is\nskipped (ETH sent as secondBridgeValue).",
   "fontSize": 16,
   "fontFamily": 2,
   "textAlign": "left",
   "verticalAlign": "top",
   "containerId": null,
   "lineHeight": 1.25,
   "autoResize": true
  },
